✔ (c) v4-4: "the box" / "the middle half" followed by "from A to B" or "between A and B" is compared with Q1 and Q3 of one drawn box (the v3 idx 9 caption) (36.1691ms)
✔ (c) v4-4: "the box plot shows values from A to B" is the data range, not the box (the v1 idx 10 caption) (8.4998ms)
✔ one_branch_decision: a decision with one outgoing edge becomes a process (312.8256ms)
✔ joined_roots: two starts with no edge between them get a synthetic start; an edge that names the other start by its label makes it that edge's child (61.4073ms)
✔ flow_loop_to_cycle: a flow that is one closed loop becomes a cycle of the same steps in order; over 7 steps it is left for the repair (55.9257ms)
✔ label_trimmed: an over-long label is cut at a word boundary and the full label kept as the node title (the renderer draws it as a tooltip) (27.8742ms)
✔ a diagram the rules cannot make valid is left exactly as written for the one repair; a valid one is untouched (17.3092ms)
✔ the corrections run before any repair, one log line each, and their count is saved on the card (2334.9128ms)
✔ the last-resort simplified diagram takes its kind from the learner's words: cycle for repeat words, sequence for messages between named actors, else flow (356.6804ms)
✔ flow_to_sequence: a handshake and a 3-party exchange drawn as straight flows become sequences, the trailing outcome kept as the caption (18.0368ms)
✔ flow_to_sequence never fires on a single-actor pipeline, a flow with a decision, a non-message step or an ambiguous receiver (15.3957ms)
✔ flow_to_sequence is logged and counted on the card like the other corrections, and a learner who named a flow keeps it (350.4198ms)
✔ sampling: the author call is temperature 0 with a seed only where the provider documents one; the repair carries the problem and samples at 0.3, unseeded (30.828ms)
✔ M5: parallel input starts that converge (the real attention flow) are joined under a fork, not a decision (51.9961ms)
✔ M3: undeclared keys in the visuals are stripped and logged on every route; a clean answer is untouched (571.5714ms)
✔ E3: bare maths in diagram text is logged and counted on the card, never repaired (171.1033ms)
