✔ C1.1: relationships are drawn as graphs, each node once; a disconnected one keeps the pairs layout (433.8642ms)
✔ a plain dated timeline sent with scaled-lanes and empty lanes becomes the plain timeline, without a repair (29.4428ms)
✔ a teaching matrix without row IDs gets them; cell counts are padded or trimmed only when unambiguous (173.2528ms)
✔ field corrections: too-long text is cut at a word, blank or multi-line optional text is cleaned, a mapping index to a missing item is dropped; anything else is left for the repair (167.5054ms)
✔ long paragraphs are split before the layout check, so a visual that ended the card finds a gap between prose (Gemini: "a visual needs prose before and after it") (38.1824ms)
